@startuml
!include ../iris-style.puml
skinparam LineType splines
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #0369A1
}
left to right direction
title D-4  Use cases: review workflow
caption From apps/reviews (routing.py, seats.py, new_version.py), RecordViewSet actions and ADR-032, ADR-047, ADR-052 on main (IR-1021).

actor Adviser
actor "Office reviewer\n(ITSO, IERC, KTTO)" as Office
actor "Office coordinator" as Coord
actor RDCO

rectangle "Review workflow" {
  usecase "See My Reviews\n(own seats and office pool)" as UC1
  usecase "Comment in anchored threads\n(Must fix, Suggestion)" as UC2
  usecase "Finish review" as UC3
  usecase "Request documents" as UC4
  usecase "Request a revision" as UC5
  usecase "Decide a Proposal:\naccept, revise or reject" as UC6
  usecase "Accept a Thesis/Research or Project\nand send it to RDCO" as UC7
  usecase "Date or release the embargo" as UC8
  usecase "Route a record to office pools\n(ITSO, IERC, KTTO in parallel)" as UC9
  usecase "Claim a seat in the office pool" as UC10
  usecase "Assign, reassign or add a reviewer;\nextend a due date" as UC11
  usecase "Clear the record\nor record a finding" as UC12
  usecase "Decide and publish,\nor keep Unlisted" as UC13
  usecase "Publish an Unlisted paper\nonce its embargo is released" as UC14
  usecase "Compare two Versions\n(Changes tab)" as UC15
  usecase "View workflow analytics" as UC16
}

Adviser --> UC1
Adviser --> UC2
Adviser --> UC3
Adviser --> UC4
Adviser --> UC5
Adviser --> UC6
Adviser --> UC7
Adviser --> UC8
RDCO --> UC8
RDCO --> UC9
RDCO --> UC13
RDCO --> UC14
RDCO --> UC16
Office --> UC1
Office --> UC10
Office --> UC12
Office --> UC2
Office --> UC5
Office --> UC16
Coord -up-|> Office
Coord --> UC11
UC3 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC12 ..> UC15 : <<extend>>
UC7 ..> UC9 : <<precedes>>
UC14 ..> UC8 : <<requires>>

note bottom of UC5 : Clearance-aware resubmission (ADR-003):\nthe new Version resets only the\nrequesting office's clearance
@enduml
